    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p15::esc1138",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "80499563662e64e329d3fa372086ec6ee91321412e4db8030720c02690cb9ff6",
      "resource_identity": "d6429d3222c1d484506c77fbd342d16cbb68ae3908825616efcaf3807275772e",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Hello",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hi, how are you feeling today?",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I'm feeling a bit confused and anxious. ",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "okay, that is valid, do you have an idea what is causing the confusion?",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "So I've been dating and my parents are aware. But recently after I said I want to go on a trip with my boyfriend, my parents have all sorts of opinions about it. And all their traditional beliefs that I did not know existed are now on the surface and they are kinda forcing me to follow it. ",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "For say they think \"bad types of woman\" go on trips with their boyfriends and I need to save myself. ",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "They have been guilt tripping me and I feel very confused.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Your feelings are valid and it is okay to feel confused in this situation considering you love your boyfriend and parents ",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Have you tried discussing with your boyfriend to talk to your parents as a means of reassuring them?",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Or getting someone neutral that your parents trust to talk to them?",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I have. It's been a long stressful month of discussion. The problem is I don't share their beliefs, and I haven't been really \"saving myself\". I'm been living away from them for collage quite a while and I've been basically doing stuff that if they found out they would be very upset about.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "But I didn't think it bothers them because they never shared any of this. ",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "And they said if I go on this trip I'm disrespecting them and the entire family. ",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "But his parents are totally cool and don't seem to mind. ",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I get how difficult and upsetting this situation is to you, i have been in a similar situation, however, in my case i took charge of my life, though they are my parents i did what i felt is good for me",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Before i continue, do you mind me asking how old you are?",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I'm 26",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "And I see what you're saying.",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It's really hard breaking free because they always monitored me my entire life. ",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I never had a voice for myself. They basically bullied and forced me to do what they wanted. ",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "BTW if you didn't guess I'm their favorite child. ",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Okay, you are old enough to be away from your parents, i am going to suggest you sitting with them down and having a heart to heart discussion with them",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Let them know the consequences of them forcing you, your feelings towards it and how unhappy you are with them restricting you",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Should I tell them everything I did that goes against what they believe? ",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "So they know that I don't share their beliefs? ",
          "turn_index": 24
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "No, i think that should be personal to you, i would not suggest you hurting or making them see you as a disappointment",
          "turn_index": 25
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I am sure you will be fine after discussing with them, they will come around",
          "turn_index": 26
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I guess worst case I won't talk to them for a while : ) ",
          "turn_index": 27
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you , that helped. ",
          "turn_index": 28
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "They might be sad and upset now but they will get over it definitely",
          "turn_index": 29
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You are welcome",
          "turn_index": 30
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Have a good one!",
          "turn_index": 31
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc1138",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You too",
          "turn_index": 32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p15::p15_conv_1",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "fa59ed0950f8e992523fb417498d80978243bee118b9efd8fedbc212b78b5917",
      "resource_identity": "7e2f9bb25bd0721fd371cb8fc12695722aaf8ea1a991f66708e957db3123f0cb",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hey Kelly, how are you doing today?",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Hey, to be honest, I'm struggling a bit.",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I'm here to listen. Do you want to share what's been challenging for you?",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It's my thesis. I had a setback recently, and it's just really bringing me down.",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can imagine that must be tough. What happened with your thesis?",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I got some feedback that I wasn't expecting. It made me realize there's a lot more work to do than I thought.",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That sounds overwhelming. It can be really hard to digest unexpected feedback.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Exactly. I was feeling quite confident before, and now I just feel lost.",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It's okay to feel that way. Remember, feedback is part of the process. How are you managing these feelings?",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Not too well, honestly. I've been pretty demotivated and haven't been able to get much done.",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It's understandable to feel stuck. Sometimes taking a step back can help. Have you tried taking a break from it all?",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I've tried, but it's hard not to think about it. It feels like I'm letting myself down.",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You're not letting yourself down. You're doing your best under challenging circumstances. Remember when your friend mentioned overcoming similar doubts in his studies?",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Oh yeah, he struggled with something similar and he got through it. It took him a bit of time though.",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Exactly. Maybe his story can be a reminder that it's possible to bounce back. Have you reached out to your friends recently?",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Not recently. Maybe I should. Talking to someone who understands might help.",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That sounds like a great idea. And remember, I'm always here for you too. You have support.",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thanks, I really appreciate that. It does help to know I'm not alone in this.",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You definitely aren't alone. How about focusing on one small step you can take today?",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Maybe I can start by reviewing the feedback more calmly, with a fresh perspective.",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
          "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That sounds like a constructive plan. Taking it step by step and being kind to yourself on the journey can make a big difference.",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p15",
          "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
